# [LSVR](../wg/lsvr.html)

## Summary

The Link State Vector Routing (LSVR) Working Group met to discuss working group document status, updates to active drafts, and proposed extensions to BGP Link-State Shortest Path First (BGP-LS-SPF). Key topics included an update on the base YANG model for BGP-LS/BGP-LS-VPN/BGP-LS-SPF, proposed updates to BGP-LS-SPF NLRI selection rules, SRv6 extensions to BGP-LS-SPF, and new proposals addressing area/region division for scaling BGP-LS-SPF in large dynamic networks such as satellite networks.

