## Decisions and Action Items

- **`draft-ietf-lsvr-bgp-ls-yang`**: Authors will incorporate missing EPN NLRI support and compound key handling for label index formats in the next revision. New TLVs (such as Flex-Algo) will be left for separate extension/augmentation drafts rather than delaying the base model.
- **WGLC / Reviews**: Early reviews for `draft-ietf-lsvr-bgp-ls-yang` will be requested from the YANG Doctors and BGP Directorate.

---

## Next Steps

- **Adoption Calls**: Call for Working Group adoption for the proposed BGP-LS-SPF NLRI selection rules update and the SRv6 extensions to BGP-LS-SPF will be conducted on the mailing list.
- **Area/Region Scaling Discussion**: Authors of the area-scoped and region-division proposals will engage operators to refine requirements and discuss use cases on the mailing list and in coordination with related routing working groups.